      "side": 1,
      "message": "FYI, this was the cause of the crash in librenderengine_test, which triggered a `ForceOpaque` pipeline compile. `sk_rgb_opaque` doesn\u0027t have uniform parameters but since the snippet entry declared one, we generated bad SkSL (since RE wasn\u0027t a debug build, we didn\u0027t catch it in the uniform expectations that weren\u0027t writing \"mode\" (which is technically correct bout counter to what the snippet declared)).\n\nRE crashed because the Recorder::snap() failed and then it passed a null Recording into `insertRecording`. This should have returned an invalid status result back to RE, but QueueManager had a bug. That is fixed in https://skia-review.git.corp.google.com/c/skia/+/1272576.",
